==== hyperbricks config {!{plugin}} ====
plugin = <PLUGIN>
plugin {
    plugin = example
    enclose = <div>|</div>
}
==== explainer ====
Wrap rendered output using prefix|suffix syntax
==== expected json ====
{
  "ConfigType": "<PLUGIN>",
  "ConfigCategory": "",
  "HyperBricksKey": "",
  "HyperBricksPath": "",
  "HyperBricksFile": "",
  "ExtraAttributes": null,
  "Enclose": "<div>|</div>",
  "PluginName": "example",
  "Classes": null,
  "Data": null
}
==== expected output ====
<div>Plugin example</div>
